        "explanations": [],
        "questions": [],
        "vocabs": [
          {
            "id": 892579,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 892580,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SPEAKER: It’s great to see so many members of the Twinning Association here tonight.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 67.89,
                  "from": 62.93,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 892594,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Since the twinning link between our two towns, Stanthorpe here in England and Malatte in France, was established, the relationship between the towns has gone from strength to strength.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 82.515,
                  "from": 68.835,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 892624,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 892625,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SPEAKER: Last month, 25 members of the association from Stanthorpe spent a weekend in Malatte.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 90.649994,
                  "from": 83.45,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 892639,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Our hosts had arranged a great programme.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 94.81,
                  "from": 91.05,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 892646,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "We learned how cheese is produced in the region and had the chance to taste the products.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 100.865,
                  "from": 94.729996,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 892664,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The theme park trip had to be cancelled, but we all had a great time on the final boat trip down the river - that was the real highlight.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 111.185,
                  "from": 101.424995,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 892693,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 892694,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SPEAKER: This is a special year for the Association because it’s 25 years since we were founded.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 116.46,
                  "from": 112.380005,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 892710,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "In Malatte, they’re planning to mark this by building a footbridge in the municipal park.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 126.06,
                  "from": 120.06,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 892725,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "We’ve been discussing what to do here and we’ve decided to plant a poplar tree in the museum gardens.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 134.835,
                  "from": 126.915,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 892744,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "We considered buying a garden seat to put there, but the authorities weren’t happy with that idea.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 141.55501,
                  "from": 135.235,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 892761,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 892762,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SPEAKER: In terms of fundraising to support our activities, we’ve done very well.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 148.67001,
                  "from": 142.75,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 892775,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Our pancake evening was well attended and made record profits.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 154.11,
                  "from": 149.15001,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 892786,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "And everyone enjoyed the demonstration of French cookery, which was nearly as successful.",
                "youpass_pick_words": [
                  "demonstration"
                ],
                "meta": {
                  "to": 161.17502,
                  "from": 154.93501,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 892800,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Numbers for our film show were limited because of the venue so we’re looking for somewhere bigger next year.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 169.49501,
                  "from": 162.05501,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 892820,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 892821,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SPEAKER: We’re looking forward to welcoming our French visitors here next week, and I know that many of you here will be hosting individuals or families.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 180.89001,
                  "from": 170.81,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 892846,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The coach from France will arrive at 5 pm on Friday.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 184.315,
                  "from": 181.69,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 892858,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Don’t try to do too much that first evening as they’ll be tired, so have dinner in the house or garden rather than eating out.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 196.71501,
                  "from": 187.27501,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 892883,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The weather looks as if it’ll be OK so you might like to plan a barbecue.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 203.27,
                  "from": 197.67,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 892898,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Then the next morning’s market day in town, and that’s always a good place to stroll around.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 210.87,
                  "from": 203.98999,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 892915,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 892916,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SPEAKER: On Saturday evening, we’ll all meet up at the football club, where once again we’ll have Toby Sharp and his band performing English and Scottish country songs.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 223.425,
                  "from": 212.145,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 892944,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Toby will already be well known to many of you as last year he organised our special quiz night and presented the prizes.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 233.54001,
                  "from": 224.34001,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 892968,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 892969,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SPEAKER: Now on Sunday, we’ll be taking our visitors to Farley House.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 280.54498,
                  "from": 275.745,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 892981,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "You may not all be familiar with it, so here’s a map to help you.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 285.71002,
                  "from": 281.23,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 892997,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "You can see the car park at the bottom of the map.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 289.55002,
                  "from": 286.27002,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 893010,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "There’s an excellent farm shop in the grounds where our visitors can buy local produce - it’s in the old stables, which is the first building you come to.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 300.765,
                  "from": 289.87,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 893038,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "They’re built around a courtyard, and the shop’s in the far corner on the left.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 307.08502,
                  "from": 301.325,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 893053,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "There’s also a small cafe on the right as you go in.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 311.245,
                  "from": 307.565,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 893065,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 893066,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SPEAKER: I know that one or two of our visitors may not be all that mobile.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 317.67,
                  "from": 312.47,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 893081,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The main entrance to the house has a lot of steps so you might want to use the disabled entry.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 324.95,
                  "from": 318.31003,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 893101,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "This is on the far side of the house from the car park.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 329.565,
                  "from": 325.645,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 893115,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 893116,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SPEAKER: Children will probably be most interested in the adventure playground.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 335.16498,
                  "from": 330.525,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 893127,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "That’s at the northern end of the larger lake, in a bend on the path that leads to the lake.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 342.44,
                  "from": 335.645,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 893147,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "There’s lots for children to do there.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 345.4,
                  "from": 342.84,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 893155,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 893156,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SPEAKER: There are a number of lovely gardens near the house.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 349.96,
                  "from": 346.19998,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 893166,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The kitchen gardens are rectangular and surrounded by a wall.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 354.59998,
                  "from": 350.36,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 893176,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "They’re to the north-east of the house, quite near the smaller lake.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 356.095,
                  "from": 355.375,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 893189,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "They’re still in use and have a great collection of fruit and vegetables.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 365.135,
                  "from": 360.335,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 893202,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 893203,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SPEAKER: The Temple of the Four Winds is a bit more of a walk - but it’s worth it.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 371.77002,
                  "from": 366.095,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 893220,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Take the path from the car park and go past the western sides of the stables and the house.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 379.21002,
                  "from": 372.25,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 893240,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Then when the path forks, take the right-hand path.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 384.01,
                  "from": 379.77002,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 893250,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Go up there with the woods on your left and the temple is right at the end.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 389.995,
                  "from": 384.715,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 893268,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "There are great views over the whole area.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 393.755,
                  "from": 390.315,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 893277,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 893278,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SPEAKER: OK, so that’s ...",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 396.315,
                  "from": 394.395,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
